# Migrations and privileges

When adding, renaming, or dropping schemas, tables, sequences, or types under `migrations/`:

1. Update [scripts/grant-privileges.sql](../../scripts/grant-privileges.sql) in the same change.
2. Mirror every object the `speculator` role needs: `REVOKE` then `GRANT`, plus `ALTER DEFAULT PRIVILEGES` for the schema when new tables may appear later.
3. Match least privilege to how the bot uses the object (read-only `strategy.registry` / `solana.*`; write (+ delete where the code deletes) on `bot.*` and `market.candles`).

Do not leave a new table or sequence without an entry in `grant-privileges.sql`.
